# Budgetinho has no backend and no build-time secrets.
#
# The only credential the app uses is your GitHub token for Gist sync, and it is
# entered in the app's Settings screen and stored in that browser's
# localStorage. It is deliberately NOT a build-time variable: anything baked in
# here would be published in the JavaScript bundle for the whole internet to read.
#
# The single optional build variable:

# Base path for the built assets. Default './' (relative) works for
# user.github.io/<repo>/, user.github.io, and custom domains alike.
# Set it only if you need absolute URLs, e.g. BASE_PATH=/Budgetinho/
# BASE_PATH=./
